## 8. Find Words That Are Substrings of Another Word

```python id="7m7g0n"
words = input("Enter words: ").split()

result = []

for i in range(len(words)):
    for j in range(len(words)):
        if i != j and words[i] in words[j]:
            result.append(words[i])
            break

print(result)
```
